\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Four-stage Soliton-Reynolds JEPA architecture. (1)\nobreakspace  {}Multiscale windowing splits telemetry at index $t$ into context ($\mathbf  {x}_{\text  {ctx}} \in \mathbb  {R}^{256 \times K}$) and target ($\mathbf  {x}_{\text  {tgt}} \in \mathbb  {R}^{64 \times K}$) blocks processed by a 4-shell dyadic real fast Fourier transform (rFFT) front-end and causal dilated temporal convolutional network (TCN). (2)\nobreakspace  {}Dual online ($E_\theta $) and exponential moving average (EMA) target ($E_\phi $) encoders tap all $L=3$ TCN stages and apply synchronized barycenter centering onto $\sqrt  {D}\mathbb  {S}^{D-1}$ ($D=32$). (3)\nobreakspace  {}Nested causal multi-horizon rollout forecasts $M=4$ sub-horizons ($S_m \in \{16, 32, 48, 64\}$) under decoupled horizon Variance-Invariance-Covariance Regularization (VICReg) and log-determinant whitening. (4)\nobreakspace  {}Mahalanobis residual whitening, Lieb--Thirring soliton concentration modulation, and coordinate-saliency-gated Streaming Peaks-Over-Threshold (SPOT) calibration under causal trailing ($\tau = t + 63$) and buffered smear mappings.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:triad_architecture}{{1}{4}{Four-stage Soliton-Reynolds JEPA architecture. (1)~Multiscale windowing splits telemetry at index $t$ into context ($\mathbf {x}_{\text {ctx}} \in \mathbb {R}^{256 \times K}$) and target ($\mathbf {x}_{\text {tgt}} \in \mathbb {R}^{64 \times K}$) blocks processed by a 4-shell dyadic real fast Fourier transform (rFFT) front-end and causal dilated temporal convolutional network (TCN). (2)~Dual online ($E_\theta $) and exponential moving average (EMA) target ($E_\phi $) encoders tap all $L=3$ TCN stages and apply synchronized barycenter centering onto $\sqrt {D}\mathbb {S}^{D-1}$ ($D=32$). (3)~Nested causal multi-horizon rollout forecasts $M=4$ sub-horizons ($S_m \in \{16, 32, 48, 64\}$) under decoupled horizon Variance-Invariance-Covariance Regularization (VICReg) and log-determinant whitening. (4)~Mahalanobis residual whitening, Lieb--Thirring soliton concentration modulation, and coordinate-saliency-gated Streaming Peaks-Over-Threshold (SPOT) calibration under causal trailing ($\tau = t + 63$) and buffered smear mappings}{figure.1}{}}
